WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.868
-Welcome back.

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:03.136
as I said, it's Friday.

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:04.970
This is when I catch up
on some personal stuff.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.506
-Really?
-I check my inbox,
I return some emails,

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.675
and, of course, I send out
thank-you notes.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.042
-Oh.
-And I was running a bit behind.

00:00:10.042 --> 00:00:11.343
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:11.343 --> 00:00:12.979
I was just wondering, if I can,

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:14.680
can I write out
some thank-you notes right now,

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.215
in front of you guys?

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:17.383
[ Cheering and applause ]
I appreciate it.

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:18.851
I'll be very quick.

00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:21.621
James, can I get some thank-you
note writing music, please?

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:22.989
-[ Playing tender tune ]

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:25.091
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:26.159
-Oh.

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:28.428
♪♪

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:31.331
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:34.633
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:37.570
-Thank you, fake vampire teeth,

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.605
for being Invisalign
for the undead.

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:43.076
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:46.746
-Ooh!

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.347
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:00:48.347 --> 00:00:51.317
Thank you, "Dune,"
or, as I like to call you,

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:52.418
dry "Aquaman."

00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:54.353
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:56.823
I call it that?
-That's what you call it.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.591
-My man Jason Momoa.
-Yeah.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:02.895
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:06.599
-Thank you, Houston Astros
and Atlanta Braves,

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:09.469
[ Cheering and applause ]
for somehow both having mascots

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:11.203
that look like
bootleg Shrek costumes.

00:01:11.203 --> 00:01:12.571
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:12.571 --> 00:01:15.008
What are these things?

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:16.275
-There was a discount.
-Go, Houston!

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:17.877
-There was a discount.
-Sure.

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:21.013
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.013 --> 00:01:23.249
Thank you, World Series trophy,

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:25.051
for looking more like an award
that's given

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:26.351
to Lipstick of the Year.

00:01:26.351 --> 00:01:27.520
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.655
Thank you.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:34.026
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.026 --> 00:01:36.195 line:0%
Thank you, Patagonia releasing

00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:38.731 line:0%
their own bottles
of natural wine,

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:41.433 line:0%
for bringing a whole new meaning
to the term white wine.

00:01:41.433 --> 00:01:46.139 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:47.841
-[ As Jerry Lewis ]
As I got it.

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.642
-[ As Jerry Lewis ] I got it.
-I think I understood that.

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:51.778
-That was pretty funny.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:52.912
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:55.614
Thank you,
couples' Halloween costumes,

00:01:55.614 --> 00:01:58.283
for all ways making it clear
which person picked the costume.

00:01:58.283 --> 00:02:01.321
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.159
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.159 --> 00:02:09.729
Thank you,
trick-or-treating chaperones,

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:11.831
for basically looking like
Secret Service agents

00:02:11.831 --> 00:02:13.699
who protect Spider-Man and Elsa.

00:02:13.699 --> 00:02:15.602
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:17.970
[ Cheering ]
-Get up there.

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:19.405
-They're going --
They're going to the door.

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:20.606
They're ringing
the doorbell now.

00:02:20.606 --> 00:02:22.141
[ Laughter ]
-The Applejack has landed.

00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:25.578
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.578 --> 00:02:26.645
♪♪

00:02:26.645 --> 00:02:28.348
-Thank you, pumpkins,

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:30.850
for being the only thing you can
just put on the ground and go,

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:31.850
"Alright, I decorated."

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:34.320
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.222 line:0%
-It works.

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:37.556 line:0%
-These gourds
have been here all year.

00:02:37.556 --> 00:02:39.192
-Yeah, they're beautiful.
-Thank you.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:41.560
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:43.762
Thank you, Halloween wigs,

00:02:43.762 --> 00:02:46.165 line:0%
for looking great in the package
and making me look like

00:02:46.165 --> 00:02:48.233 line:0%
Spooky Boris Johnson
when I put it on.

00:02:48.233 --> 00:02:51.871
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:53.106
This is Aquaman?

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:55.441
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.507 --> 00:02:56.575
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.575 --> 00:02:59.311
Thank you,
spider web decorations,

00:02:59.311 --> 00:03:01.847
for being cotton balls going
through a goth phase.

00:03:01.847 --> 00:03:03.149
[ Laughter and applause ]
There you have it everybody.

00:03:03.149 --> 00:03:04.217
Those are our thank-you notes.

